# Cloudflare Pages routing for get.virtues.com.
#
# When you connect this repo to Cloudflare Pages with build output = `scripts/`,
# anyone hitting https://get.virtues.com/ gets the install script directly:
#
#     $ curl -sSL https://get.virtues.com | sudo sh
#
# Also serves the install script at `/install.sh` explicitly (200 = no
# external redirect, just rewrites the response).
/                /install.sh   200
/install         /install.sh   200
